00:07:02,900 --> 00:07:12,780
 So, uh, initialization is the process, uh, the handshake process that the client and the server go through, um, when establishing communication.

62
00:07:13,100 --> 00:07:18,340
 So the way that that normally works is the client will send an initialize RPC request to the server.

63
00:07:18,340 --> 00:07:22,140
