00:09:19,980 --> 00:09:36,700
 So, um, definitely want to take a look at that instructions, um, response in these, um, servers initialization response, um, and see if the client is doing something weird with that instructions, uh, that you might be able to utilize as an attacker from the malicious MCP server perspective.

83
00:09:37,340 --> 00:09:41,660
 So, um, server info and protocol version are both a little bit, um, boring.

