00:11:11,380 --> 00:11:12,380
 We'll talk about that later.

102
00:11:12,380 --> 00:11:20,380
 Um, or if you are a client, you definitely want to check and see in your assessing MCP server, what kind of resources the server supports.

103
00:11:20,380 --> 00:11:30,900
 And even if it doesn't list resources here in the, um, uh, initialization response, it may, you may still be able to use the resources, read, um, uh,

