00:12:50,340 --> 00:13:01,420
 Um, so, or at least that's been my experience in my limited experience. So, um, realize that you might want to look at the MCP client that, uh, you're interacting with it and make sure that they support some of these compatibilities.

116
00:13:01,420 --> 00:13:08,420
 Even from a code perspective, even if they're turned off in the compatibilities, um, uh, initialization.

