00:14:22,420 --> 00:14:26,420
 What you might see is some path leaks or some disclosures that might give you some good information.

126
00:14:26,420 --> 00:14:40,420
 Um, moving from roots to the next objects, we have sampling. Okay. And sampling is great because it allows the MCP server to query the LLM and make, uh, messages for the user.

