00:17:00,420 --> 00:17:01,420
 Okay.

156
00:17:01,420 --> 00:17:15,420
 Uh, once again, another great spot for, um, injections, whether it be, uh, XSS, uh, something of the like there, but I love the trust and safety and security, uh, announcement that they put on this part of the, of the protocol.

157
00:17:15,420 --> 00:17:23,420
 It says, um, uh, servers must not use elicitation to request sensitive information from the user.

158
00:17:23,420 --> 00:17:24,420
 Okay.

159
00:17:24,420 --> 00:17:25,420
 Must not do that guys.

160
00:17:25,420 --> 00:17:26,420
 Seriously guys.

161
00:17:26,420 --> 00:17:27,420
 Don't do that.

162
00:17:27,420 --> 00:17:28,420
 Please don't do that.

163
00:17:28,420 --> 00:17:29,420
 Yeah.

164
00:17:29,420 --> 00:17:31,420
 That's exactly what we're going to do.

