00:17:31,420 --> 00:17:38,420
 Um, so very interesting, uh, sort of functionality here for attackers that are in the malicious MCP server perspective.

166
00:17:38,420 --> 00:17:54,420
 Um, I think that there will also be situations where there will be no user interaction elicitation requests, where the server will request a piece of information from the client and the client will say, oh, I've got that, you know, in my little environment store or something like that.

